==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} card was available as part of the [[Mission (TCG Pocket)#ex Starter Deck Missions|ex Starter Deck Missions]] missions, which ran from March 28 to April 27, 2025, and was awarded to players who collected 50 cards during the mission period.

